Cooperative Soil Survey characterisation database (\code{dataset == "US-NCSS"}, 8 profiles, US public domain). Values are the standardised
WoSIS values; profiles without any analytical data are omitted. Positions
of the WISE profiles are uncertain by more than 10 km. See
\code{data-raw/make_data.R} for the download and processing code.
